    "introduction": "Convatec develops medical products used in managing chronic conditions, including wound care, ostomy care, continence care and infusion-related applications. Its products support patients in hospitals, community settings and at home, often requiring repeat purchases of consumable items. Revenue comes from supplying these products through healthcare providers, distributors and patient-service channels. Clinical performance, comfort and ease of use are important because products may form part of daily care. The business combines medical-device development with manufacturing and customer support. Demand depends on treatment needs and healthcare access, while reimbursement arrangements, quality standards and reliable supply influence how products reach patients and generate recurring revenue.",
